<title>GERMANY: GOLF-EUROPEAN TOURNAMENT PLAYERS' CHAMPIIONSHIP SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-EUROPEAN TOURNAMENT PLAYERS' CHAMPIIONSHIP SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final round scores and totals in the European Tournament Players' Championship on Sunday (Britain unless stated);</p>
